y", "id": "35599321183049705"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "4.2.1: Matchmaking Improvements (5/23/26)\nDev Note: The next update will involve rewriting the game from scratch in a new netcode framework to improve hitboxes. This will be the game\u2019s biggest update to date, and will probably take at least 1-3 months.\n\nMatchmaking Filters\n- Filters help avoid the worst possible experience: playing against someone who is way above your skill level. \n- Replaced skill lock system with a three-tier skill level filter: \u201cfair matches\u201d, \u201cwide matches\u201d, or \u201cany matches\u201d. Each filter makes a trade off between match fairness and queue time length. Hosts can choose a filter for their lobby, and joiners can choose a filter while searching for lobbies.  \n- Added a popup warning for players when they try to join a much higher level lobby\n\nRating System Improvements\n- Your skill level updates immediately after you or the host leaves the lobby. Leaving has always counted as a loss, but the update would be delayed, so it was hard to tell. \n- You can see the skill level of each player in the lobby UI and in their player profile\n\nImproved Report System\n- Improved the accuracy of the report system\u2019s detection system based on player appeals\n\nBug Fixes\n- Fixed issues where lobby vote-start system might not work\n- Fixed some UI visual glitches", "created_date": 1779671813, "id": "35599321183049705", "version": "4.2.1", "version_code": 199, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released